      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 030 Micro DC Motor with SH1.0 connector is a compact and efficient motor, perfect for space-constrained projects. Its 1.5mm output shaft and SH1.0 connector ensure easy and reliable connections, making it ideal for robotics, small appliances, and various electronic applications."
