class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Rated Voltage\n<p>(V)</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Operating Voltage\n<p>(V)</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; width: 11.2201%;\">\n<div>Rated load\n<p>(G*CM）</p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Direction of <br/>Rotation</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Operating<br/>Temperature Range</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Storage<br/>Temperature Range</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Position of <br/>Motor</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">LA024</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">DC 8.0V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">DC 1.0V～8V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">5.0G-CM</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">CW＆CCW</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">-10℃～+50℃</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">-30℃～+85℃</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">All position</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>The 030 Micro DC Motor with SH1.0 connector is a compact and efficient motor, perfect for space-constrained projects. Its 1.5mm output shaft and SH1.0 connector ensure easy and reliable connections, making it ideal for robotics, small appliances, and various electronic applications.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
